| ShortSummary = Josh investigates the fall of the Mayan Empire. He explores the many cenotes— caverns believed to be gateways to the underworld—below the jungles and ruins of Mexico, including the largest Mayan city, Chichén Itzá. While scuba diving in the dark Holtun Cenote, he unearths human skulls and ancient sacrificial altars, which get him closer to why their empire collapsed.
